  "body": "Assumingly caused by the previously added check for room consistency, client logins fail or load forever due to a missing event response. Depending on how tech savey the affected user is, it is hard to get the actual event id because at least with loglevel ERROR, synapse does not write anything to the logs.\r\n\r\nElement-android seems to load forever as people wrote me and Fluffy returns a bit more info.\r\n\r\nI know that there is a similar issue, but this query https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/12549#issuecomment-1119552850 returns `0 rows` for me and i don't find errors in my log... (has the loglevel for this problem changed?) .\r\n",
